{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17767","headline":"赠侯侍御 · 杨巨源","name":"赠侯侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"步逸辞羣迹，机真结远心。\n敦诗扬大雅，映古酌高音。\n逃祸栖蜗舍，因醒解豸簪。\n紫兰秋露湿，黄鹤晚天阴。\n旧业余荒草，寒山出远林。\n月明多宿寺，世乱重悲琴。\n霄汉时应在，诗书道未沈。\n坐期阊阖霁，云暖一开襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}